/E (P/ PRABHAVEE, founded and led by lawyer Anumita Sarkar \(independent policy and strategic advisor\), is a Delhi-based strategy consulting practice working at the intersection of policy, law, and business strategy. P/ PRABHAVEE focuses on Human Rights and Responsible Business, and achieves this through strategic advisory and guidance, multi-stakeholder initiatives, facilitation, consultations, training & capacity building, and strategic programmes. Since 2022, P/ PRABHAVEE has engaged in strategic consultation with close to 20 CSOs, NGOs, social impact start-ups, including mid-to-established organisations, and has engaged with over 40 organisations, including 5 Higher academic institutions and universities, collaborating with more than 120 experts across the social sector, academia, and public policy. It has trained over 1100 individuals and certified close to 100 individuals in the prevention of sexual harassment of women at the workplace. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (P/ PRABHAVEE contributes to global standard-setting and policy processes, including regular participation in GRI standards development consultations, submissions to the UN Working Group on Business and Human Rights, and pre-consultations with UNDP for Annual UNRBHR Forums. Its recent engagements include input on the EU Forced Labour Regulations, alongside contributions to a range of national and international policy and stakeholder consultations.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
