<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 130 0 R
/T (This mid-year review questionnaire was designed as a strategic self-assessment and risk governance tool to help organisations evaluate the effectiveness of their PoSH implementation beyond statutory compliance. This exercise was strategised to encourage leadership, Internal Committee members, HR teams, and key stakeholders to reflect on emerging workplace risks, organisational culture, reporting mechanisms, inquiry processes, and preventive measures. The broader objective was to identify strengths, gaps, and areas where course correction is required, enabling organisations to develop their own roadmap for the next 6-12 months and support them in strengthening commitment to creating safe, respectful, and inclusive workplaces. )
/E (This mid-year review questionnaire was designed as a strategic self-assessment and risk governance tool to help organisations evaluate the effectiveness of their PoSH implementation beyond statutory compliance. This exercise was strategised to encourage leadership, Internal Committee members, HR teams, and key stakeholders to reflect on emerging workplace risks, organisational culture, reporting mechanisms, inquiry processes, and preventive measures. The broader objective was to identify strengths, gaps, and areas where course correction is required, enabling organisations to develop their own roadmap for the next 6-12 months and support them in strengthening commitment to creating safe, respectful, and inclusive workplaces. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
