/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (The consultation witnessed several strategic insights that reflect the evolving landscape of workplace governance under the PoSH framework. Rather than identifying isolated compliance concerns, the discussions revealed broader institutional challenges requiring sustained leadership attention and systemic reform.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
