/P 133 0 R
/E (The increase in complaints is considered proof of awareness and readiness to use the reporting mechanisms. However, at the same time, it was indicated by the participants that employees in many organisations do not feel encouraged to report because of the fear of punishment, the existing hierarchy, as well as the issue of confidentiality. This indicates a systemic cultural issue in the organisation rather than a compliance issue and needs to be dealt with seriously.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
