/P 147 0 R
/E (Q2 and Q3 of the financial year are important times for organisations to evaluate initiatives, assess progress, and course-correct where necessary. Mid-year review offered an opportunity not only to check compliance status but also to reflect on organisational practices, strengthen institutional mechanisms, and align workplace conduct with evolving expectations of responsible governance.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
